6a (SP6a) 及之后的安全累积更新。此漏洞位于 smss.exe 调试子系统中，攻击者通过复制特权进程句柄即可提升至 SYSTEM 权限，补丁已强制校验进程间连接的认证。如无法升级，建议限制本地用户登录权限并移除不必要的调试权限。作为最后手段，可在组策略中禁用系统调试功能以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=101614320402695&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8462.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/262074","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/264441","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/264927","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4287","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-024","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A158","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A76","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2002-0367","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21344","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2002/CVE-2002-0367.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0367.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0367","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0367.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/nvd_advisories/CVE-2002-0367.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2002-0367.html","https://github.com/ossf/cve-bin-tool/blob/eed106eba1ebaab041d56363df0f7ec1dcb9b8c6/cve_bin_tool/cvedb.py","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/krafthack-by-techday/Night-s-watch/blob/30ae1bcc335306fe4c5507b2c629cae4932e515e/cve/nvd/CVE-2002-0367_dcf591e8-9103-43b3-b4bc-cf